source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-22
observed: Jira autolinks a bare URL in prose without changing its visible text.
-- input.jira --
http://example.com
-- rendered.html --
<p><a href="http://example.com" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">http://example.com</a></p>
-- want.md --
http://example.com
